        "description": "Ed25519 request signature. Signed material: POST\\n<path>\\n<protocol>\\n<node_key>\\n<database_id>\\n<body_sha256 hex>\\n<issued_at>\\n<nonce>. Companion headers: X-LastDB-Node-Key, X-LastDB-Database-Id, X-LastDB-Issued-At, X-LastDB-Nonce, X-LastDB-Relay-Protocol. Skew \u00b160s. Required on every relay request (including reads). grant#any means any signed caller may read \u2014 not unsigned access. Append/put also require a current write (or submit for proposals) grant; missing/bad sig \u2192 401; no grant \u2192 403 forbidden."
